            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0m0ecdbedbe84d280e363e604c2d7b6b3e652625352e3d7508570c694b694a5f5430754a345267416f4e7472714f6d1d262922432c72176b073f3435666d777b4227623a727d1d7745626f3c231d623c3c"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_100APPLE_IMG_0152.JPG",
            "media": "4d9b95601fff.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0m0ecdbedbe84d280e363e604c2d7b6b3e6b2e653558045d1e6c32624a7d5d7d456c7636377d4e436f397e60444c4a0c202922432c72176b073f3434666d777b1025603b712c407c45626f3c231d623c3d"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "大阪ライブ、東京ライブまだチケットあるので是非これる人は遊びにきてね。行きたいのにどうしても都合つかなくて行けないんじゃ〜〜な人は寂しい思いさせてごめんなさい(´；ω；`)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大阪和东京的演唱会都还有票，能来的朋友请一定来玩哦。至于那些明明想去、却实在抽不出空来不了的朋友，让你们寂寞了，对不起(´；ω；`)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "There are still tickets for the Osaka and Tokyo lives, so please come if you can. For those who really want to come but just can't make it, I'm sorry for making you feel lonely(´；ω；`)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "大阪、東京ライブの真ん中くらいに放送またできたらするのでちょっとでも寂しいが和らいだらいいな。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "在大阪、东京两场演唱会之间，如果还能再做一次节目的话我会做的，哪怕能让大家稍微排解一点寂寞也好。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If I can, I'll do another broadcast somewhere between the Osaka and Tokyo lives, so I hope that eases the loneliness even a little."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "それじゃあまた！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那么，下次见！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Well then, see you!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
